{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sTcg1LZO50YJaz1l5QZ6Uw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:03.921623+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sTcg1LZO50YJaz1l5QZ6Uw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uQcI7rowuVeib9EYLiaZB36sRZPwUMzDoQic1icU3o7NrqcPWe92gvGn320XKia9sXLEwID3ABZIOEDtR8RTWwgaic2YdUNFnrUvQnbHabNZazseQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong><span><span>学院简介</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>海军工程大学核科学技术学院是国内最早开设核专业的院校之一，建设发展与国家核事业紧密相连、休戚与共。</span><span><span>1989</span></span><span>年获得“反应堆工程与反应堆安全”硕士学位授予权，</span><span><span>1996</span></span><span>年获“核能科学与工程”博士学位授予权，</span><span><span>2009</span></span><span>年建立“核科学与技术”博士后科研流动站，</span><span><span>2012</span></span><span>年获“核科学与技术”一级学科博士学位授予权，</span><span><span>2013</span></span><span>年舰船核动力工程实验室被评为军队重点实验室，</span><span><span>2013</span></span><span>年被评为湖北省一级学科重点建设学科，2019</span><span>年被列为军队“十三五”重点学科专业，</span><span><span>2021</span></span><span>年列入军委专项研究生培养计划。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span>申请时间：2026年7月9日-7月15日（报名体检截止时间）</span></section><section><span>举办时间：2026年7月20日-7月22日</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><table><thead><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>内</span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span><span>容</span></span></p></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>20</span></span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span>周一</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1200-1800</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>营员报到</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1930-2030</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>开营仪式</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>21</span></span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span>周二</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>0830-1130</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>招生宣讲会</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1430-1600</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>科研学术交流会</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1630-1730</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>参观校园</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>22</span></span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span>周三</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>0700-1200</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>离营</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>夏令营面向人群</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span>1.有意向入伍读研的“双一流”推免生</span></section><section><span>获得2027年推免资格的“双一流”建设高校理学和工学门类本科生。招录流程主要包括预报名初审、体格检查和政治考核、复试选拔等。详细招录政策以学校正式发布公告为准。</span></section><section><span>2.有意向报考我院地方研究生的本科生和硕士生</span></section><section><span>理工类专业在校本科生可报考我校地方硕士研究生，硕士生可报考我校地方博士研究生，欢迎来我校参观交流。</span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究生招生计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span>我校核科学与核技术专业下设5个研究方向：</span></section><section><span>1.舰船核动力工程（军队）</span></section><section><span>2.舰船核安全与辐射防护（军队）</span></section><section><span>3.核战斗部运用与保障工程（军队）</span></section><section><span>4.核动力工程（地方）</span></section><section><span>5.核安全与辐射防护（地方）</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uQcI7rowuVeJFMWUJql0Rxwg6lwfgFL7ibfo3FYpqOwiaibzcKrOwlnyX8v4jO2soUQdtrnX0IMdnJXKcaibOH23vXomLMsahQICIbccNibn51j4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span>请提供以下4类材料，申请阶段只需提交扫描电子版，入营报到时需提供对应原件:</span></section><section><span>1.《2026年“核星汇聚”暑期夏令营报名表》；</span></section><section><span>2.本科在读期间学业成绩表；</span></section><section><span>3.本人第二代居民身份证正反面复印件；</span></section><section><span>4.其他证明材料（各类获奖证书、资格证书、发表论文、CET-4、CET-6成绩单等复印件各一份）。</span></section><section><span>文件请按以上顺序扫描成PDF格式文件，以“姓名+所在高校名称+所在专业名称”命名方式发送至nuenuclear@163.com，学院将在收到邮件后的3个工作日内通过邮件回复报名申请结果。</span></section><section><span>我们承诺对您所提供的信息严格保密，请理解您提交的申请材料将不再退还，重要材料请您注意备份留存。</span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>激励政策</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span>1.活动期间夏令营提供营员食宿，以及资助所在高校或家庭住址至武汉的往返路费（参照我校研究生标准报销）。</span></section><section><span>2.入伍硕士研究生在校待遇：拟入伍的“双一流”高校应届本科毕业生入学复查复检通过后，办理入伍手续，授予海军专业技术少尉军衔。在校期间，享受少尉军官工资待遇，对符合条件的，每月发放父母赡养费等（父母同时享受军队优惠医疗待遇），同时免收学费、教材费、住宿费、伙食费等。硕士毕业后，可继续攻读军队博士研究生，或分配至军队单位工作。</span></section><section><span>3.录取为我校地方博士/硕士研究生后，读研期间按照学校相关文件发放奖助学金：</span></section><section><span>①新生奖学金：硕士最高5000元，博士最高8000元。</span></section><section><span>②助研津贴：根据助研岗位，硕士1000元至3000元/月；博士3000元至9000元/月。</span></section><section><span>③学业奖学金：硕士最高12000元/年，博士最高18000元/年。</span></section><section><span>④就餐补贴：每年按照一定标准发放10个月餐补。</span></section><section><span>⑤国家助学金、国家奖学金等其他奖学金参照国家和学校有关规定执行。</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uQcI7rowuVcRhRmsFoiaZM6CQ7ia70KAM3bicsqmTEDzjgGGg7OaQtZNGhWqAdqZ8ias3lLe5a55t9iadEFtc1yQkkb1jjZATMkAU6Hy3nsv3ibKQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>海军工程大学核科学技术学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>教科处 余老师（夏令营活动咨询）</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span><span><span>13476036918</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>教科处 程老师（招生政策咨询）</span></span></p><p><span>电话：18717186300</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>附件：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sTcg1LZO50YJaz1l5QZ6Uw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>2026年“核星汇聚”暑期夏令营报名表.docx</span></a></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/uQcI7rowuVfQOya43RcAv1tutWuSwCfKgcbtrsKwkMMGpv1JSqa8f9QaV595TEicxo3DvkbicghfP1yHdHQyKoibNllibhfibEL00icib16OeFVjLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"bef38756544438c0e141361d2e1d9ebc3af5c3990bea4b7cc48f5c96a7ccb5fd","textLength":1501,"sourceSha256":"bce712d47b36b9f75a7bc64a6a9905b6c50a94ba85a5e194d8c6e86ffe512071","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-53ade27d47c2b4c44d82","title":"2026年海军工程大学核科学技术学院夏令营活动报名","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:03.921623+00:00"}
